Third-party material
--------------------
latch/src/robot_description/
  Copied from MoveIt's moveit_resources (panda_description, version 2.0.7,
  https://github.com/moveit/moveit_resources). Per that package, the URDF and
  meshes were copied from Franka Robotics' franka_ros and released under
  Apache-2.0. Modified here: a camera model was added (urdf/camera/), and the
  URDF was adapted for Gazebo and ros2_control.

latch/src/panda_moveit_config/
  Derived from MoveIt's moveit_resources (panda_moveit_config, version 2.0.7),
  declared BSD by its authors. Modified here: this cell's launch files,
  scripts and Gazebo world were added.

latch/src/panda_moveit_config/worlds/{ground_plane,sun,table}/
  Gazebo's standard models by Open Robotics (author: Nate Koenig), from the
  Gazebo model database, Apache-2.0.

latch/src/yolov8_obb_msgs/
  The message layout (Yolov8Inference, InferenceResult) follows the Robot Mania
  YOLOv8 ROS 2 tutorial; the remaining messages are original.
